{"id": "q_longmont_session_12_council_chamber_roster", "question": "Who's actually in the council chamber for the Session 12 fight with the Wolf?", "answer": "TL;DR: The fight in the council chamber includes the Players, the Wolf, Thalia, and multiple Guards (including elite ones); council members are not explicitly confirmed present in the projection.\n\nBased on OBSERVED and CANON facts:\n\n- Players: Present and actively engaged (“Party is actively in battle” and directly interacting with the council beforehand).\n- The Wolf: Explicitly in the “Council Room” and the central adversary of the encounter.\n- Thalia: Present with the Wolf (“Wolf is standing at Thalia’s shoulder”) and participates in combat after his instruction.\n- Guards: Present in force—both regular and elite guards are involved, with some already in the chamber and others arriving as reinforcements (“guards are being drawn here as reinforcements,” “8 regular guards and 2 elite guards”).\n\nNotably absent:\n- Council members are referenced indirectly (players recounting their story to them), but there is no explicit confirmation they remain in the chamber during the fight.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Demographics: Players (group of 6); Guards (8 regular + 2 elite).\n- Roles: Wolf (central adversary), Thalia (commanding combatant), Guards (reinforcements/obstacles), Players (active combatants).\n- Location: Council Chambers (large circular room with active magical defenses and reinforcements arriving).", "has_error": false, "retrieval": {"enabled": true, "top_k": 30, "pre_filter_count": 732, "post_filter_count": 30, "duration_ms": 21, "top_5": [["ent_the_wolf", 2.0561], ["ent_branching_paths_after_the_fight", 1.8017], ["ent_city_council", 1.6405], ["ent_battle_with_the_wolf_in_the_council_chamber", 1.6], ["ent_arcane_locks", 1.5269]], "selected_entity_ids": ["ent_the_wolf", "ent_branching_paths_after_the_fight", "ent_city_council", "ent_battle_with_the_wolf_in_the_council_chamber", "ent_arcane_locks", "en