{"id": "q_wolf_status", "question": "End of Session 12: is the Wolf alive, dead, still corrupted-what's his state?", "answer": "TL;DR: The Wolf is dead at the end of Session 12—specifically **“Decapitated; head removed from body”**—and there’s no evidence his corruption was cured before death.\n\nThe **OBSERVED physical_condition** explicitly includes **“Decapitated; head removed from body”**, which is a terminal outcome and overrides earlier states like being invisible or escaping. Supporting this, **ent_bonogo** is noted to have “Removed the Wolf’s head to transport it,” confirming the kill occurred in play.\n\nRegarding corruption: the Wolf previously had **“an oily sheen to his eyes”** (OBSERVED), indicating active corruption. There is no OBSERVED fact stating this condition was removed or resolved prior to death, so the most grounded conclusion is that he died **while still corrupted**.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Physical Condition: **“Decapitated; head removed from body”**, previously had oily sheen in eyes (corrupted)\n- Operational Status: Previously escaping/invisible, but superseded by death\n- Faction/Role: Cultist, central adversary\n- History: Attacked by Bonogo; ultimately killed and beheaded by him", "has_error": false, "retrieval": {"enabled": true, "top_k": 30, "pre_filter_count": 732, "post_filter_count": 30, "duration_ms": 26, "top_5": [["ent_the_wolf", 1.8276], ["ent_guards", 1.7858], ["ent_speak_with_dead", 1.5514], ["ent_dead_horse", 1.5454], ["ent_knife", 1.4479]], "selected_entity_ids": ["ent_the_wolf", "ent_guards", "ent_speak_with_dead", "ent_dead_horse", "ent_knife", "ent_battle_with_the_wolf_in_the_council_chamber", "ent_stafl", "ent_bonogo", "ent_stone_bridge", "ent_dead_horses_owner", "ent_session_13_the_meaty_and_the_dead", "ent_guard", "ent_thalia", "ent_shepherds_flock_cultists", "ent_stormspire_academy", "ent_meat_flies", "ent_out_town", "ent_sprite", "ent_necromancer", "ent_ephanna_the_kenku_warlock", "ent_karsemine_the_tiefling_ranger"