{"id": "q_thalia", "question": "Was Thalia corrupted or just played-and how does that tie to the Wolf?", "answer": "TL;DR: Thalia was **not corrupted in the same way as the guards**—she was **ensorcelled/controlled by the Wolf**, meaning she was being played rather than willingly complicit.\n\nThalia’s state is consistently described as **“ensorcelled (unbeknownst to her)” and “ensorcelled by the Wolf” (OBSERVED)**, while also explicitly noting **“Thalia does not have an oily sheen to her eyes.” (OBSERVED)** The oily sheen is a known marker of corruption affecting others (e.g., guards), so her lack of it distinguishes her condition.\n\nHer behavior lines up with manipulation rather than allegiance:\n- She **“serves the Wolf” (OBSERVED)** and **attacks the group after the Wolf’s instruction (OBSERVED)**  \n- But her mental state includes **“Innocent” and “Realizes how dire the situation truly is” (OBSERVED)**, and **her charmed status ended (OBSERVED)**  \n- She **can be convinced of the Wolf’s betrayal (OBSERVED)**\n\nThe Wolf, meanwhile, is a **cultist and corrupting influence (OBSERVED/CANON)** who actively manipulates others and issues commands.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Thalia (Commander of the Guard): ensorcelled, no oily sheen, can be convinced, believed she was acting correctly\n- The Wolf: cultist, deceptive, exerts control over others, issues commands to Thalia\n\nConclusion: Thalia was **magically influenced and misled by the Wolf**, not fundamentally corrupted—her loyalty was hijacked, not chosen.", "has_error": false, "retrieval": {"enabled": true, "top_k": 30, "pre_filter_count": 732, "post_filter_count": 30, "duration_ms": 24, "top_5": [["ent_thalia", 2.32], ["ent_the_wolf", 2.28], ["ent_commander_thalia_ashenvale", 2.16], ["ent_first_sewer_encounter_corrupted_patrol", 1.2226], ["ent_secret_doors", 1.2226]], "selected_entity_ids": ["ent_thalia", "ent_the_wolf", "ent_commander_thalia_ashenvale", "ent_first_sewer_encounter_corrupted_patrol", "ent_secret_doors", "ent_guards", "ent_magical_alarm_system", "ent_battle_with_the_wolf_in_the_council_chamber", "ent_magical_runes", "ent_corrupted_meat", "ent_flesh_golem", "ent_corrupted_guard_patrol", "ent_covert_ops_mission", "ent_sewers", "ent_agricultural_district", "ent_bonogo", "ent_book", "ent_broken_structure", "ent_caelynn_the_half_elf_sorcerer", "ent_charm_and_enchantment", "ent_copper_rivets", "ent_cult_suspect_locations", "ent_cultist_acolyte", "ent_elara_greenleaf", "ent_escape_tunnel", "ent_head_alchemist", "ent_herbal_shop", "ent_kirfan", "ent_mushroom_card", "ent_one_persistent_bugbear_or_sneaky_fucking_bugbear"], "semantic_rerank": {"enabled": false}, "evidence_first": {"enabled": true, "duration_ms": 8, "top_k": 24, "neighbor_window": 1, "max_neighbors": 24, "selected_count": 82, "seeded_count": 48, "selected_evidence_ids": ["evid_4985bfe2913d47b7", "evid_dc141fef49e97d33", "evid_e4dd94715c0a8b20", "evid_b6a14783735fa06c", "evid_b4ac9fb978606150", "evid_8f29e07e935ababb", "evid_280b7649d99ff04f", "evid_d18a7c2abbcb5d20", "evid_6d0b0e70d12469e0", "evid_387500eea866f771", "evid_0d675abafc0947bf", "evid_6d5e5ba4133cc803", "evid_a627779b5534d72a", "evid_b810741feddfd044", "evid_769ec4142c3bc2b8", "evid_18b5851b42563586", "evid_b6a14783735fa06c", "evid_b4ac9fb978606150", "evid_8f29e07e935ababb", "evid_4f8f0ba2981ce405", "evid_41cbd8c7a6096846", "evid_a58ec5347c341b3a", "evid_85000303479049ec", "evid_3d17055ee5d21b46", "evid_c57b9060657e2c9a", "evid_3098c5781c67cb95", "evid_4f8f0ba2981ce405", "evid_41cbd8c7a6096846", "evid_a58ec5347c341b3a", "evid_85000303479049ec", "evid_3d17055ee5d21b46", "evid_c57b9060657e2c9a", "evid_3098c5781c67cb95", "evid_b1e17200d2661419", "evid_889c40d9eecbc4b0", "evid_2b6210fa67e69fac", "evid_8ce139314602edcc", "evid_88f3dc09f67c3de6", "evid_6bff58d8f28e47f1", "evid_c1b8186b1232700d", "evid_b1e17200d2661419", "evid_d865883c57001d2c", "evid_f0ebbaade20b4b34", "evid_ea0c72cdfd04df16", "evid_cb5ee831d0f2a09e", "evid_4453ef201405d7c3", "evid_38